# Keep the build context small and free of local state.
.git
# The image rebuilds the UI in its own node stage; a host node_modules would
# be both huge and wrong (native deps built for the host platform).
web/node_modules
# ~400MB of bundled linux ffmpeg/ffprobe for the bare-metal dist layout. The
# image installs its own via apt, so this is build context Docker copies and
# never opens.
internal/toolchain/assets
.cache
data
dist
bin
quarantine
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.tar.gz
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
**/._*
docs
README.md
